# Bible-Tools NT vs OT Unified HTML Generator — Rendering Gap Root Cause and Xref Fix (2026-06-13)

## Core Insight
The NT (John-1) and OT (Proverbs-13) unified_analysis.html files were generated by DIFFERENT versions of the same generator. The gap is overwhelmingly a **rendering gap, not a data gap**.

## Critical Bug: Sidebar Xref Text Is Always Empty
Line ~129 of `unified_html_generator.py`:
- BUG: `txt.get("text", "")` — WRONG KEY, key is "es" not "text"
- FIX: `txt.get("es", "") or txt.get("gr", "")`
This causes ALL xref popup calls to pass empty string: `showXrefPopup('Ref', '')`.

## Xref Rendering Difference
- NT: 160 xref-pill spans with data-ref/data-es/data-gr/data-lxx attributes → rich multilingual popup
- OT: plain xref-entry divs → popup shows nothing (data is there, rendering is wrong)

## Data Available But Not Rendered in OT
- D.morphology: Hebrew WLC word-by-word (fills #greek-N divs at runtime via JS)
- D.lxx_morphology: LXX Greek morphology (fills #lxx-N divs)
- D.parallel.WLC: full Hebrew text per verse
- D.translations: 9 versions (RVR60, RVR1909, KJV, ASV, BSB, Darby, LITV, YLT, Vulgate)
- D.xrefs: 53 entries with text.es (all), text.gr (NT-pointing refs only)
Missing rendered UI: multi-version panel, per-verse buttons, keyboard nav, dark mode, progress bar

## Common Misconceptions Corrected
1. Hebrew/LXX text DOES render — #greek-N and #lxx-N look empty in HTML source but JS fills them
2. Patristic content IS present in current OT file (11 verses have content with themes/consensus bars)
3. D.parallel.WLC IS populated with Hebrew text for all 25 Proverbs verses

## NT showXrefPopup Convention for OT Refs
The NT popup detects OT books by checking the ref string:
- data-gr = Hebrew WLC text for OT refs (displayed RTL)
- data-lxx = LXX Greek for OT refs  
- data-gr = Greek for NT refs
- data-es = Spanish for all refs
Follow this same convention in OT xref pill rendering.

## Missing Languages for 4-Language Popup
- Spanish (es): all 53 OT xrefs have it
- Hebrew (gr for OT refs): 38 OT→OT refs have empty gr field — needs DB query
- LXX Greek (lxx): missing from all refs — needs DB query
- English KJV (en): missing from ALL refs in BOTH NT and OT — needs new field

## Priority Fixes
P0: Fix sidebar bug (5 min), replace xref-entry with xref-pill (1hr), copy NT showXrefPopup (1hr), fetch Hebrew/LXX/KJV for xrefs (2-3hr)
P1: Per-verse button row (1.5hr), multi-version panel (0.5hr), keyboard nav (1hr)
P2: Copy verse, personal notes, dark mode, progress bar (~2.5hr total)
P3: Hebrew binyan significance notes, consonantal text toggle, chapter summary card
P4: Exegesis data (Keil & Delitzsch ingest)
EOF
